drain sig      absent                   0x55                     DEVICE SIGNATURE: only the 8042 answers 0x55 to a load from ISA 0x60 FAIL
deassert ann   no                       yes                      DISCRIMINATOR: the SECOND stub -- reached only once the queue empties FAIL
deassert honest no                       yes                      SIBLING PARITY: the deassert announce owes the same reason its sibling does FAIL
assert once    0                        1                        BOUND: two full IRQ cycles, and the assert announce may appear exactly ONCE FAIL
deassert once  0                        1                        BOUND: same for the sibling -- a latch that resets is a log flood, not a latch FAIL
